{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>To stand before the congregation to serve them.</b> To serve the exalted One with song, and His Tabernacle with the labor of carrying and the like. And He desired that you perform this service before the congregation, in order to make known their deficiency — that they are disqualified from the service, while you were chosen in their stead."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:05.342826474Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}